// HTML Server example.
// The current plugin serves its built-in Appeal page through the HTTP service.
// A later version can use Net_Resources_Path to serve HTML files.
// Run only one of the included server examples at a time.

Network Server

Print "Generic Network Server started"
Print "The default HTML page is available at the configured local IP and HTTP port"
Print Var Net_Local_IP
Print Var Net_HTTP_Port
Print "Use Network Stop_Server to stop the server"

Return
